            <guid>kqxsfg3q</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[The jump packs of Vanguard Veterans allow them to bound across the battlefield in a series of jet-propelled leaps or drop into the fight from the holds of circling gunships. This helps them counter the gravest threats, fighting with peerless skill and wielding punishing close-quarters weaponry to devastating effect. These elite warriors are a great fit in any Space Marine army and in today’s video, Ollie shows you how to paint them in the colours of the Blood Angels Chapter.]]></description>
